# MCP usage

## Cloudflare (`cloudflare-api`)

Project MCP: `.cursor/mcp.json` → `https://mcp.cloudflare.com/mcp` (OAuth on first connect).

Use for Pages project status, DNS/custom domain checks, analytics tokens, and deploy-related questions. Prefer MCP/docs tools over guessing dashboard state. Do not paste secrets into tool args.

## Browser (`cursor-ide-browser`)

Use for visual/a11y verification of `npm run preview` or production:

1. `browser_navigate` → target URL
2. `browser_lock` → lock
3. `browser_snapshot` (structure) and/or `browser_take_screenshot` (visual)
4. Unlock when done

Skill `verify-marketing-site` wraps the full smoke path.

## Do not

- Fabricate Cloudflare config or analytics numbers
- Rely on screenshots alone for interaction — snapshot for refs
- Enable unrelated MCP servers in this repo (Roblox, Firebase game backend, etc.)
